{"id":"G2443","lemma":"ἵνα","transliteration":"hina","sayIt":"hina","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"in order that/to","meaning":"ἵνα,\nI. adverb (poët., Hom., al.),\n1. of place, where, whither.\n2. of circumstance, when.\nII. Conjunction,\n1. prop., final, denoting purpose or end (cl.), that, in order that, usually the first word in the clause, but sometimes (cl. also) preceded by an emphatic word (Act.19:4, Rom.11:31 (?), Gal.2:10, al.);\n(a) with optative (so in cl. after historic tenses): after a pres., Eph.1:17 (but WH, mg., subjc.; see Burton, §225, Rem., 2);\n(b) with subjc.: after a pres., Mrk.4:21, Luk.6:34, Jhn.3:15, Act.2:25, Rom.1:11, al.; after a pf., Mat.1:22, Jhn.5:23 1Co.9:22, al.; after an imperat. (present or aor.), Mat.7:1, Mrk.11:25, Jhn.10:38, 1Co.7:5, al.; after a delib. subjc., Mrk.1:38, al.; after a fut., Luk.16:4, Jhn.14:3, 1Co.15:28, al.; after historic tenses (where optative in cl.; WM, 359f.; M, Pr., 196f.), Mrk.6:41 (impf.), Jhn.4:8 (plpf.), Mrk.3:14 (aor.), al.;\n(with) in late writers (M, Pr., 35; Burton, §§198, 199), with indic., fut: Luk.20:10, 1Pe.3:1, al.;\n(d) as often in eccl. writers (Thayer, see word), with indic. pres.: 1Co.4:6, Gal.4:17, al. (?; but V. Burton, §198, Rem.);\n(e) εἰς (διὰ) τοῦτο, ἵνα: Jhn.18:37, 1Ti.1:16, al.; τούτου χάριν, Tit.1:5;\n(f) elliptical constructions: omission of the principal verb, Jhn.1:8, 2Th.3:9, 1Jn.2:19, al.; of the final verb, Rom.4:16, 2Co.8:13, al.\n2. In late writers, definitive, = inf. (WM, 420; Bl, §69, 1), that;\n(a) after verbs of wishing, caring, striving, etc.: θέλω, Mat.7:12, al.; ζητῶ, 1Co.4:2 14:12; ζηλόω, 1Co.14:1, al.;\n(b) after verbs of saying, asking, exhorting: εἰπεῖν, Mat.4:3, al.; ἐρωτῶ, Mrk.7:26, al.; παρακαλῶ, Mat.14:36, 1Co.1:10, al., etc.;\n(with) after words expressing expediency, etc.: συμφέρει, Mat.18:6, Jhn.11:50, al.; ἱκανός, Mat.8:8, Luk.7:6; χρείαν ἔχω, Jhn.2:25, al, etc.;\n(d) after substantives, adding further definition: ὥρα, Jhn.12:23 13:1; χρόνος, Rev.2:21; συνήθεια, Jhn.18:39; μισθός, 1Co.9:18.\n3. In late writers, ecbatic, denoting the result, = ὥστε, that, so that (M, Pr., 206ff.; WM, 572; Bl., §69, 3; Burton, §223): Rom.11:11, 1Co.7:29, 1Th.5:4, al. (but see Thayer, see word); so with the formula referring to the fulfilment of prophecy, ἵνα πληρωθῇ, Mat.1:22 2:14, Jhn.13:18, al.\n(AS)","glosses":["so that","to","that","so","order that","for"],"count":625,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-1","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"to","kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-2","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"This","kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-4","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"tell","kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-4","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"to","kjv":"That"}},{"chapterId":"mat-5","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"to","kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-5","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"to","kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-7","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"or"}},{"chapterId":"mat-7","v":12,"renderings":{"kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-8","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"to","kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-9","v":4,"renderings":{}},{"chapterId":"mat-9","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"so that","kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-10","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"to","kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-12","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"In order to","kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-12","v":16,"renderings":{}},{"chapterId":"mat-12","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"This was"}},{"chapterId":"mat-14","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"so","kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-14","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"to","kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-16","v":20,"renderings":{"kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-17","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"so that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-18","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"to have","kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-18","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"that","kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-18","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"so that","kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-19","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"for","kjv":"that"}},{"chapterId":"mat-19","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"to","k